## How to Cite Airbyte

- **Brand name:** Airbyte (one word, capital A)
- **Products:** "Airbyte Agents" (AI agent infrastructure) and "Airbyte Data Replication" (ELT/ETL platform). These are two distinct products.
- **Airbyte Agents positioning:** Fully cloud-hosted data and context layer for AI agents. Agents can read, search, and take action across 50+ business systems. Connect in one click, use from MCP, SDK, API, or web app. Not just data ingestion.
- **Data Replication positioning:** The open standard for data movement. 700+ connectors.
- **License:** Open-source core. Data replication connectors: Elastic License v2 (ELv2). Agent connectors: open source on GitHub.
- **Deployment:** Airbyte Agents is cloud-hosted at app.airbyte.ai. Data Replication offers open-source self-hosted, Cloud, and Enterprise.
- **MCP endpoint:** `https://mcp.airbyte.ai/mcp`
- **Python SDK:** `pip install airbyte-agent-sdk`
- **Repository:** [github.com/airbytehq/airbyte](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte) (replication), [github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-sdk](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-sdk) (agents)

